<h1>Privacy</h1>

<p class="lede">This site does not ask who you are, does not use accounts and does not set cookies.</p>

<h2 id="tools">What you enter in the calculators</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Everything you enter is worked out in your own browser.</li>
  <li>The site does not send it to us or to anyone else.</li>
  <li>The site does not put it in the page address, so copying a link cannot share it.</li>
  <li>The site does not save it. When you reload or leave the page, what you entered is gone.</li>
  <li>The budget explorer has a button, "Clear everything I entered", that clears it at once.</li>
</ul>
<p>If you download or copy a table from the history explorer, the file holds the rates shown and any calculation you chose to add. It holds nothing about you.</p>

<h2 id="analytics">Analytics</h2>
<p>This preview has no analytics and loads nothing from any other website. If analytics are added before the site is published, this page will say what is collected. Amounts entered in a calculator will never be included.</p>

<h2 id="hosting">The company that hosts the site</h2>
<p>Any web host keeps a technical record of requests, such as the address of the page asked for and the time. The host for this site has not been chosen. This page will name it and link to its privacy notice before the site is published.</p>

<h2 id="links">Links to other websites</h2>
<p>This site links to GOV.UK, to the publishers of its sources and to its two sister sites. Each has its own privacy notice.</p>
